/E (Muhammed Ijlan TK is a postgraduate student in Environmental Science with a growing focus on Environmental, Social and Governance \(ESG\) analysis and sustainability reporting. His academic and independent research work focuses on evaluating how environmental risks, social responsibilities, and governance practices influence corporate performance and long-term sustainability.)
